MID_MV13_02: <SH>
MID_MV13_02_m001: (pained exert as she tumbles) (breath exert)
MID_MV13_02_m002: (breath exerts)
MID_MV13_02_m003: Is that...
MID_MV13_02_m004: Mahadu?
MID_MV13_02_m005: Young woman.
MID_MV13_02_m006: Do you seek power?
MID_MV13_02_m007: I do.
MID_MV13_02_m008: What I seek is a great strength.
MID_MV13_02_m009: An unyielding strength for any foe.
MID_MV13_02_m010: Sheer strength, to uphold the faith I hold dear.
MID_MV13_02_m011: Above all...I need the strength to lead my people.
MID_MV13_02_m012: Strength enough for a queen!
MID_MV13_02_m013: (breath of surprise)
MID_MV13_02_m014: (pained exert) (breath exert)
MID_MV13_02_m015: (pained exerts)
MID_MV13_02_m016: (attack exert)
MID_MV13_02_m017: Well, damn. This isn't looking too great.
MID_MV13_02_m018: What happened to all that strength of yours?
MID_MV13_02_m019: (surprised reaction exert)
MID_MV13_02_m020: (surprised reaction exert)
MID_MV13_02_m021: What's all that rumbling?
MID_MV13_02_m022: Do you think we angered the forest spirits somehow?
MID_MV13_02_m023: Feel that? The rumbling's coming from the tomb!
MID_MV13_02_m024: (powerful shout exert)
MID_MV13_02_m025: Pardon my absence.
MID_MV13_02_m026: Is that not—
MID_MV13_02_m027: Boss!
MID_MV13_02_m028: Your Highness! You retrieved the arm without issue?
MID_MV13_02_m029: Our ancestor has granted me this power.\nMay our next fight enlighten you...
MID_MV13_02_m030: that any weakness I had is gone!